Tie-breaking 3-column ASC (fully deterministic order):
== Query ==
SELECT c_a, c_b, c_c, count(*), sum(val)
FROM tie_breaker
GROUP BY c_a, c_b, c_c
ORDER BY c_a ASC, c_b ASC, c_c ASC;

